  -Add Fix ignored clock enable return value in init patch
---
Change in v6:
 -Fix all clock leak paths comprehensively:
 -PCIe syscon update failure path
 -SATA DPLL lock check path
 -SATA errata path in ti_pipe3_exit()
---
