Reported-by: Sashiko <sashiko-bot@kernel.org>
Closes: https://lore.kernel.org/bpf/20260614015716.945AF1F000E9@smtp.kernel.org/
Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-5.5
Signed-off-by: Tamir Duberstein <tamird@kernel.org>
